1
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:15,400
This is Meridian Solar: thirteen jobs running in one workspace, on the day they are actually running.

2
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:24,400
Two hundred and twenty-eight open tasks. Fourteen of them late. Nine inspections on the file.

3
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:36,200
One job holds its phases, its tasks, its permits and its money, on the same record the crew sees.

4
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:47,200
Every roof photograph is filed against the job, and against the step it proves.

5
00:00:48,800 --> 00:00:58,200
Every task names an owner, a due date, and the work that has to finish before it can start.

6
00:00:59,800 --> 00:01:08,200
When hail comes through, the customers it touched are the next list.
